<div id="S2.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The PPI dataset comprises several graphs, so the quantities marked with an “a”, represent the characteristic of the average graph .</p>
